{"reference":"2 Samuel 17","book":"2 Samuel","chapter":17,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Within 2 Samuel","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"Second Samuel traces David’s rise and consolidation as king, then moves through the ark and dynasty promise into royal abuse, household violence, rebellion, grief, and a closing appendix. Chapter 17 belongs within the rebellion portion of that larger movement.","verse_refs":["2 Samuel 1","2 Samuel 10:1-19","2 Samuel 11:1-27","2 Samuel 12:1-31","2 Samuel 13:1-39","2 Samuel 14:1-33","2 Samuel 15:1-37","2 Samuel 16:1-23","2 Samuel 18:1-33","2 Samuel 19:1-43","2 Samuel 20:1-26","2 Samuel 21:1-22","2 Samuel 22:1-51","2 Samuel 23:1-39","2 Samuel 24:1-25","2 Samuel 2:1-32","2 Samuel 3:1-39","2 Samuel 4:1-12","2 Samuel 5:1-25","2 Samuel 6:1-23","2 Samuel 7:1-29","2 Samuel 8:1-18","2 Samuel 9:1-13"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_2_samuel_017_0f3a986ece1b1c4513e47c37"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}